    "description": "<p>You enhance a creature's reflexes, helping it to strike and defend in the right place at the right time.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>30 spaces</strong>. It increases its <strong>Defense</strong> and <strong>Melee</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the bonus to both <strong>Defense</strong> and <strong>Melee</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 additional successes.</p><p>You may also increase the number of targets by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.csquZaxXAG2KqDxI]{Battle Meditation}</p>",
